# Build context of the image: code and locked dependencies only.
# Secrets and working data never go into a layer (a deleted file stays in the layer below).
# hidden files and folders of the dev machine: .git, .venv, .env, caches, editor and tool settings
.*
secrets/
**/__pycache__
# notes in the project root; the package metadata needs README.md
/*.md
!README.md

# not needed at runtime
tests/
scripts/
docs/

# runtime files of the dev machine (real data): the container gets its own volume
instance/
